## About Recover

Recover is about restoring operations and capacity after an incident, communicating the recovery work, and drawing lessons for future improvements.

## Key areas

- Recovery plans and priorities
- Safe restoration of systems
- Communication with stakeholders
- Lessons learned and improvements
